  "usage_note": "A **hobby** is usually something you choose to do regularly for pleasure, such as painting, collecting stamps, or playing an instrument. Simply resting is not usually called a hobby. In conversation, *What do you do in your free time?* is often more natural than *What are your hobbies?*",
